num and the follow-up won  them a Grammy for Best folk album fili  who grew up listening to a Prairie Home  Companion first appeared on the  broadcast in 1996 at age 15 what do you  remember about it I remember everything  about dad I remember I remember walking  to the department store on the way there  to get a nice shirt  because I didn't have one he would  perform on the show 24 times before  becoming its host what about the  intimidation factor of succeeding  Garrison Keillor my perception of other  people's perception of this handoff is  that there's no way it could work but  somehow you liked the challenge of that  but think about it the pressures off  haha like it's because you're a failure  already well no just because no one  thinks it can happen yes and and so if  it can that'll be a hell of a good  surprise

